2026-07-27T08:44:07.9476330Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:44:07.9537794Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:44:07.9539262Z i /tmp/RtmpG5adpr/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:44:07.9540006Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:44:07.9540549Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:44:07.9541127Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:44:07.9541650Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:44:07.9542557Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:44:07.9543143Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:44:07.9785807Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:44:07.9892408Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:44:08.0318421Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:44:08.0468973Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
